        "title": "Mutual confirmation",
        "position": {
          "x": 980,
          "y": 200
        },
        "engine": "claude",
        "model": "",
        "prompt": "Obtain final confirmation from the counterparty: send the revised contract for review, track feedback clause by clause, address counterproposals and update versions, and confirm both parties agree on all clauses. Produce the final contract and negotiation minutes.",
