        "engine": "hermes",
        "model": "",
        "prompt": "Execute signing and archiving: initiate electronic signatures (both parties plus timestamps), verify signatory authority and seal validity, archive in the contract management system, and set key milestone reminders (payments, deliveries, renewal windows). Produce signed contract files and an archive index.",
